8553.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"For https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12734\r\n\r\n# Features\r\n- Render\r\n  - [x] Vulkan\r\n- Input\r\n  - [x] Touch Event\r\n  - [x] Text Input\r\n  - [x] Mouse Event\r\n  - [x] Keyboard Event\r\n- Audio\r\n  - [x] Renderer\r\n  - [x] Capturer\r\n- DispayServer\r\n  - [x] Portrait Layout\r\n  - [x] Landscape Layout\r\n  - [x] Window Resize\r\n  - [x] IME Control\r\n  - [x] Clipboard\r\n- Scripts\r\n  - [x] GDScript\r\n- Network\r\n  - [x] TCP/IP stack\r\n  - [x] HTTP\r\n  - [x] HTTPS (TLS)\r\n- Export\r\n  - [x] Export Project \r\n  - [x] Run\r\n  - [x] Debug\r\n\r\n# Build export template\r\n1. Download [OpenHarmony SDK](https://gitee.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v5.1.0-release.md#acquiring-source-code-from-mirrors)\r\n2. Uncompress to any path. e.g. `C:/ohos-sdk-windows_linux-public/ohos-sdk/windows/{toolchains,previewer,js,ets,native}/`\r\n4. Run `scons.exe platform=openharmony target=template_debug generate_bundle=yes module_mono_enabled=no  OPENHARMONY_SDK_PATH=\"C:/ohos-sdk-windows_linux-public/ohos-sdk/windows\"`\r\n\r\n# Build app\r\n1. Download [Commandline Tools](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/download/command-line-tools-for-hmos)\r\n2. Uncompress to any path. e.g. `C:/command-line-tools`\r\n3. Set `C:/command-line-tools` to Editor Settings (Export > OpenHarmony > OpenHarmony Tool Path)\r\n4. Run export project in editor\r\n\r\n# Stable version for Godot 4.4.1\r\nhttps://github.com/kdada/godot/tree/openharmony","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108553/reactions","total_count":58,"+1":38,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":11,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":9},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108553/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}